# KabuhayanAI — Module Gap Analysis & Implementation Plan

> **Purpose:** Documents the delta between **what is currently implemented** vs. **what is required** per the 7 module specifications. Each module section lists what exists, what is missing, and what needs to change.

---

## 1. 🤖 Gabay AI — Conversational AI Coach

### ✅ Currently Implemented
- Basic chat UI (user ↔ Gabay bubbles) with Gemini streaming
- Taglish/Filipino suggestions as quick-start prompts
- Persists chat history in localStorage
- Awards XP on first message per session

### ❌ Missing / Misaligned
| Gap | Required Behavior |
|-----|-------------------|
| **No voice-to-text input** | Users should be able to speak their questions/expenses instead of typing. Requires `SpeechRecognition` Web API with a mic button in the input bar. |
| **No RAFI-specific knowledge** | Gabay only gives generic financial advice. Needs a knowledge base or system prompt injection covering RAFI loan products, insurance claims process, and repayment coaching. |
| **No insurance claim support** | Module explicitly requires explaining insurance claims — not present. |
| **No loan repayment coaching** | Gabay should proactively coach on RAFI loan repayment schedules based on user data. |
| **Language selection is implicit** | Module specifies Cebuano / Filipino / English — Cebuano responses are not explicitly prompted or tested. A language toggle (Cebuano · Filipino · English) should be added. |

### 🔧 Changes Needed
- Add mic button → `SpeechRecognition` (Web Speech API) for voice-to-text
- Expand Gemini system prompt with RAFI loan products, repayment, and insurance info
- Add a language preference toggle (Cebuano / Filipino / English) stored in profile
- Inject language preference into system instruction
- Add RAFI-specific quick-start prompts (e.g., "Kailan ko babayaran ang utang ko?" / "Pano mag-claim ng insurance?")

