## 2. 🐷 Ipon Tracker — Smart Savings Coach

### ✅ Currently Implemented
- Create savings goals with name, target amount, and deadline
- Deposit amounts per goal with optional notes
- Progress ring with % and history log
- Celebrates goal completion with confetti + XP

### ❌ Missing / Misaligned
| Gap | Required Behavior |
|-----|-------------------|
| **No AI-powered savings planner** | Module requires AI to suggest a *personalized savings plan* — e.g., "Save ₱X per day to reach your goal by [date]." |
| **No progress nudges** | Should send push/in-app notifications or toast nudges aligned with RAFI micro-savings products. |
| **No RAFI micro-savings product tie-in** | No mention of RAFI products or linkage to RAFI savings accounts. |
| **No weekly AI-generated savings tip** | Home has a weekly tip widget, but Ipon page itself has no AI coaching message based on the user's goal progress or spending. |
| **No spending-based tips** | Module says tips are "based on spending" — Ipon page doesn't read transaction data to tailor advice. |

### 🔧 Changes Needed
- Add an AI savings coach panel per goal: "Para maabot mo ang ₱5,000 sa loob ng 30 araw, kailangan mong mag-ipon ng ₱167/araw."
- Add a `generateSavingsPlan(goal, transactions)` function in `ai.ts`
- Add in-app nudge system (toast + Gabay suggestion link) triggered when user hasn't deposited in X days
- Add RAFI micro-savings product info cards linked from Ipon page
- Show AI-generated insight beneath each goal card based on spending habits

