## 3. 🎮 FinQuest — Gamified Finance Education

### ✅ Currently Implemented (as `Missions.tsx`)
- Daily & weekly mission list with static hardcoded missions
- Mark missions as complete manually with a button
- XP reward + confetti on completion
- Basic Negosyante character avatar displayed elsewhere (Home, Palakasan)

### ❌ Missing / Misaligned
| Gap | Required Behavior |
|-----|-------------------|
| **No character leveling narrative / "Negosyante" story** | Module requires a "Sari-sari store" story arc — users level their character through real financial tasks. No character progression story. |
| **Missions manually marked complete** | Real tasks (loan payments, savings top-ups) should trigger automatic mission completion. Currently ALL missions require a manual button tap. |
| **No story-based mission system** | Module calls for "story-based missions with Open a sari-sari store narrative." Only flat mission lists exist. |
| **No weekly challenges with specific rules** | e.g., "Save ₱50 for 7 days straight" — needs the app to verify streaks across 7 days from `deposits` data. |
| **No community leaderboard (barangay)** | Palakasan exists but it's a separate module. FinQuest should have group/barangay context leaderboards. |
| **No RAFI CBM module content** | Module specifies using RAFI Micro-finance Capacity Building Modules for gamified education content. No RAFI-specific educational content in missions. |
| **No avatar progression UI** | AvatarArt component exists, but there's no dedicated level-up screen, avatar customization, or progression story. |

### 🔧 Changes Needed
- Build a dedicated "Negosyante Journey" story arc screen with stages (Magsasaka → Tindera → Sari-sari → Negosyante)
- Hook automatic mission completion to: savings deposits, loan repayment log events, Gabay chats, receipt scans
- Add streak-based weekly challenges with automated verification from `deposits[]` and `transactions[]` data
- Integrate RAFI CBM educational content as mission descriptions / in-mission learning cards
- Add barangay/group context to missions (phase 2 — requires Tambayan integration)
- Design a character progression screen with visual stage upgrades

