## 7. 🤝 Tambayan — Community Savings Groups / Digital Paluwagan

### ✅ Currently Implemented (as `Tambayan.tsx`)
- Community feed / social posts with heart reactions
- Post timestamp display, author avatar, heart count
- "Coming soon" toast on the New Post button

### ❌ Missing / Misaligned
| Gap | Required Behavior |
|-----|-------------------|
| **Wrong product entirely** | Current Tambayan is a social feed. Module requires a **digital paluwagan** — a rotating savings group where members commit to weekly/monthly contributions and each member collects once. |
| **No group creation/joining** | No ability to create or join a paluwagan group with other RAFI clients. |
| **No contribution tracking** | No concept of members, rounds, payment order, or contribution history. |
| **No completion reward integration** | Module states that upon paluwagan completion, all members get Kabuhayan Points. Not implemented. |
| **No RAFI client member system** | Requires a multi-user backend eventually; can be mocked with invite codes for demo. |

### 🔧 Changes Needed
- Redesign Tambayan page completely as a **Paluwagan Hub**
- Build group creation flow: group name, member slots, contribution amount, frequency (weekly/monthly), duration
- Build member invitation (mock: copy link / invite code)
- Track round-robin payout order and contribution status per member per round
- Add contribution confirmation flow with XP + points reward on completion
- Keep social feed as a secondary "Community Wall" tab within Tambayan

