## Summary Table

| Module | Tab Exists | Core Feature Works | Missing Critical Features |
|--------|------------|-------------------|--------------------------|
| **Gabay AI** | ✅ | ✅ Partial (no voice, no RAFI knowledge) | Voice-to-text, RAFI loan/insurance prompts, language toggle |
| **Ipon Tracker** | ✅ | ✅ Partial (goals/deposits work) | AI savings plan, nudges, RAFI product tie-in |
| **FinQuest** | ✅ (Missions) | ⚠️ Very basic | Auto-completion triggers, story arc, RAFI CBM content, avatar progression |
| **Palakasan Rewards** | ✅ | ⚠️ Leaderboard only | Voucher store, MSME catalog, redemption flow, behavior-based triggers |
| **Gastos Analyzer** | ✅ | ✅ Works well | Loan readiness score, real AI insights (not hardcoded) |
| **Kwento ng Pera** | ✅ | ⚠️ Wrong product | Personal credit narrative, payment history, loan officer share |
| **Tambayan** | ✅ | ❌ Wrong product | Digital paluwagan, group creation, round-robin tracking, completion rewards |

---

## Recommended Priority Order

1. **Gabay AI** — Voice input + RAFI system prompt (high demo impact, quick win)
2. **Gastos Analyzer** — Loan readiness score (ties to RAFI's core product)
3. **Palakasan Rewards** — Add voucher store tab (high user retention impact)
4. **Ipon Tracker** — AI savings plan per goal
5. **FinQuest** — Auto-mission triggers + RAFI CBM content
6. **Kwento ng Pera** — Rebuild as personal credit narrative
7. **Tambayan** — Paluwagan redesign (most complex, requires multi-user architecture)

---

> **Note:** All modules currently use `localStorage` for data persistence — no backend. Multi-user features (Palakasan leaderboard, Tambayan paluwagan) will need either a mock/seed data approach for demo or a lightweight backend (Supabase / Firebase) for real implementation.
